  "title": "Espey Mfg. & Electronics Corp. reports third quarter results",
  "summary": "Saratoga Springs, NY, May 12, 2026 – Espey Mfg. & Electronics Corp. (NYSE American: ESP) announces results for the first nine months of fiscal year 2026. Net sales for the third quarter ending March 31, 2026, were $11,422,655 compared with last year’s third quarter net sales of $10,302,719. Net income for the quarter was $2,864,662, […]",
